    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/ea787dd9744861170c32172c92e31510.poster.avif?t=1755196256\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/ea787dd9744861170c32172c92e31510.webm?t=1755196256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/ea787dd9744861170c32172c92e31510.mp4?t=1755196256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Don't know if you would like the game? Try the demo!</u></strong><br><br> <strong><u>ABOUT</u></strong><br>Unleash powerful spells, dodge intense bullet-hell attacks, and defeat formidable bosses in this action-packed rogue-lite RPG. Customize your hero with Pets, Perks, Classes, Cosmetics and <strong>MORE</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>CONQUER EACH FLOOR</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, Blast, and Dodge your way up the tower with over 100+ unique spells. Each spell has a unique form and plays differently than the last. Whether you're freezing enemies with a glacial spike, or hurling meteors down on your foes, master them to melt through enemies and climb even higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/f700591b00b68bbc30a7d0b0268791d2.poster.avif?t=1755196256\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/f700591b00b68bbc30a7d0b0268791d2.webm?t=1755196256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/f700591b00b68bbc30a7d0b0268791d2.mp4?t=1755196256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><u>BECOME SUPER POWERFUL</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading a spell isn\u2019t just a stat boost, it\u2019s a transformation. Each upgrade reshapes the spell into something stronger, flashier, and way more fun. With most spells evolving across three tiers, you\u2019re free to go 'all-in' on your favorites, and unleash their full potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/07a737e6da38e4b9f6aa884a5b62e494.poster.avif?t=1755196256\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/07a737e6da38e4b9f6aa884a5b62e494.webm?t=1755196256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/07a737e6da38e4b9f6aa884a5b62e494.mp4?t=1755196256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong> <u>CUSTOMIZE YOUR BUILD</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's a new class, pet, perk, mask, or cosmetic, there are thousands of combinations to make each and every run feel fresh.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/38e8396fc64edd755b2edc111485525f.poster.avif?t=1755196256\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/38e8396fc64edd755b2edc111485525f.webm?t=1755196256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/38e8396fc64edd755b2edc111485525f.mp4?t=1755196256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>DISCOVER</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various NPC's that aid you on your path.\u00a0Seek out forgotten chambers, sacred masks, and powerful boss runes, each one pulsing with power and waiting to reshape your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/207ddf10a983349a991794ee752c59be.poster.avif?t=1755196256\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/207ddf10a983349a991794ee752c59be.webm?t=1755196256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/207ddf10a983349a991794ee752c59be.mp4?t=1755196256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>FACE THE CHALLENGE</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the guardians of the tower in EPIC boss battles! Do you have what it takes to come out on top?<br>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/0312c7f534dc9be2162bb0791832e17e.poster.avif?t=1755196256\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/0312c7f534dc9be2162bb0791832e17e.webm?t=1755196256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/0312c7f534dc9be2162bb0791832e17e.mp4?t=1755196256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <u><strong>Key Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way, with several unique classes to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ unique spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face dozens of enemy types and super challenging bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Spell Upgrade System that <u><i>isn't</i></u> just a number increase.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore many diverse biomes each filled with new dangerous enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level-Up and assign stat points to further shape your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover NPC's in the tower that will help you face even greater threats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unique perks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of Pet Companions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loads of Cosmetics that unlock via achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find masks with unique abilities which will surely shake up your current run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Gacha <u><i>without</i></u> microtransactions. (In-game currency only)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss perks! - After defeating a boss, choose an additional perk to help you climb higher.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand Designed floors with randomized twists to keep every run fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Status Effects Galore - Freeze, burn, stun, and poison. Show those enemies who's boss!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shops!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty options to tailor each run to your skill and mood.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/ea787dd9744861170c32172c92e31510.poster.avif?t=1755196256\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/ea787dd9744861170c32172c92e31510.webm?t=1755196256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/ea787dd9744861170c32172c92e31510.mp4?t=1755196256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Don't know if you would like the game? Try the demo!</u></strong><br><br> <strong><u>ABOUT</u></strong><br>Unleash powerful spells, dodge intense bullet-hell attacks, and defeat formidable bosses in this action-packed rogue-lite RPG. Customize your hero with Pets, Perks, Classes, Cosmetics and <strong>MORE</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>CONQUER EACH FLOOR</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, Blast, and Dodge your way up the tower with over 100+ unique spells. Each spell has a unique form and plays differently than the last. Whether you're freezing enemies with a glacial spike, or hurling meteors down on your foes, master them to melt through enemies and climb even higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/f700591b00b68bbc30a7d0b0268791d2.poster.avif?t=1755196256\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/f700591b00b68bbc30a7d0b0268791d2.webm?t=1755196256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/f700591b00b68bbc30a7d0b0268791d2.mp4?t=1755196256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><u>BECOME SUPER POWERFUL</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading a spell isn\u2019t just a stat boost, it\u2019s a transformation. Each upgrade reshapes the spell into something stronger, flashier, and way more fun. With most spells evolving across three tiers, you\u2019re free to go 'all-in' on your favorites, and unleash their full potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/07a737e6da38e4b9f6aa884a5b62e494.poster.avif?t=1755196256\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/07a737e6da38e4b9f6aa884a5b62e494.webm?t=1755196256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/07a737e6da38e4b9f6aa884a5b62e494.mp4?t=1755196256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong> <u>CUSTOMIZE YOUR BUILD</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's a new class, pet, perk, mask, or cosmetic, there are thousands of combinations to make each and every run feel fresh.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/38e8396fc64edd755b2edc111485525f.poster.avif?t=1755196256\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/38e8396fc64edd755b2edc111485525f.webm?t=1755196256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src