deo/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <u><strong>Key Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way, with several unique classes to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ unique spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face dozens of enemy types and super challenging bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Spell Upgrade System that <u><i>isn't</i></u> just a number increase.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore many diverse biomes each filled with new dangerous enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level-Up and assign stat points to further shape your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover NPC's in the tower that will help you face even greater threats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unique perks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of Pet Companions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loads of Cosmetics that unlock via achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find masks with unique abilities which will surely shake up your current run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Gacha <u><i>without</i></u> microtransactions. (In-game currency only)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss perks! - After defeating a boss, choose an additional perk to help you climb higher.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand Designed floors with randomized twists to keep every run fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Status Effects Galore - Freeze, burn, stun, and poison. Show those enemies who's boss!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shops!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty options to tailor each run to your skill and mood.</p></li></ul>",
